{"id":"bc4db49d023a67c9","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-goldreich-levin.md","title":"Goldreich-Levin Hard-Core Predicate","display":"thm-goldreich-levin — Goldreich-Levin Hard-Core Predicate","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-goldreich-levin","aliases":["28-thm-goldreich-levin","Goldreich-Levin Theorem"],"display":"thm-goldreich-levin — Goldreich-Levin Hard-Core Predicate","depends_on":["[[28-df-one-way-function]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-negl]]","[[28-df-hardcore-predicate]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 9.12; printed p.183; PDF p.209","source_printed_pages":"183","source_pdf_pages":"209","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"not-audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-goldreich-levin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-goldreich-levin</span><span>Goldreich-Levin Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-goldreich-levin — Goldreich-Levin Hard-Core Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c4afc9766080d5a\" href=\"?note=5c4afc9766080d5a\" title=\"28-df-hardcore-predicate\">28-df-hardcore-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 9.12; printed p.183; PDF p.209"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"183"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"209"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}\">\\(f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f|_{\\Sigma^n}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma^n\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f|_{\\Sigma^n}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma^n\\)</span> 为双射。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^n\">\\(\\Sigma^n\\)</span> 上均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,r\">\\(x,r\\)</span> 独立按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 抽样；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\odot r=\\bigoplus_{j=1}^n x_jr_j\\in\\Sigma\">\\(x\\odot r=\\bigoplus_{j=1}^n x_jr_j\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>，空和为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\">\\(\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c4afc9766080d5a\" href=\"?note=5c4afc9766080d5a\" title=\"28-df-hardcore-predicate\">28-df-hardcore-predicate</a> 的一比特输出预测器类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1\\)</span> 为由比特 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 组成的单字符字串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>；概率同时包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的独立随机性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr_{x,r\\leftarrow U_n}\\left[A\\bigl(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(f(x),r)\\bigr)=\\langle x\\odot r\\rangle\\right]-\\frac12\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr_{x,r\\leftarrow U_n}\\left[A\\bigl(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(f(x),r)\\bigr)=\\langle x\\odot r\\rangle\\right]-\\frac12\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：已核对单向置换版本陈述及优势取补；Goldreich–Levin 求逆构造与定量分析仍未完整独立核验。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>严格对应本书定理 9.12 的单向置换版本；书中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 与随后保长度条件冲突，按其上下文应为字符串到字符串。本次修正该显然的值域排印错误。原稿把固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 映射写成全局 OWF，并未给扩展输入编码；这里直接写明随机内积位结论。推广到任意单向函数的 Goldreich–Levin 形式更强，未借本页陈述擅自核验。绝对优势由对预测器取补得到。\n修订说明：预测器量词显式限制到一比特输出子类。若保留对全部字符串输出 PPT 的绝对优势量词，恒输出空串者会使该断言失败；配对输入和被预测比特的字串类型现已写明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-one-way-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-hardcore-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5c4afc9766080d5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-hardcore-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}$，见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]，且 $\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f|_{\\Sigma^n}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma^n$ 为双射。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-hardcore-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5c4afc9766080d5a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}$ 是 [[28-df-hardcore-predicate]] 的一比特输出预测器类；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$\\langle b\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1$ 为由比特 $b$ 组成的单字符字串，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；概率同时包括 $A$ 的独立随机性。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}$ 是 [[28-df-hardcore-predicate]] 的一比特输出预测器类；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$\\langle b\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1$ 为由比特 $b$ 组成的单字符字串，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；概率同时包括 $A$ 的独立随机性。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}$ 是 [[28-df-hardcore-predicate]] 的一比特输出预测器类；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$\\langle b\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1$ 为由比特 $b$ 组成的单字符字串，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；概率同时包括 $A$ 的独立随机性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f|_{\\Sigma^n}:\\Sigma^n\\to\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"x,r","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\odot r=\\bigoplus_{j=1}^n x_jr_j\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle b\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\;\\left(n\\mapsto\\left|\\Pr_{x,r\\leftarrow U_n}\\left[A\\bigl(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(f(x),r)\\bigr)=\\langle x\\odot r\\rangle\\right]-\\frac12\\right|\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.","display":true},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2473,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"构造与证明工具：[[28-thm-goldreich-levin]]、[[28-thm-prg-from-owf]]、[[28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization]]、[[28-df-hybrid-distribution]]。"}],"outgoing":["76af324ae3acb27e","b75200f005282ddf","f3171800627deef3","5c4